500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 mx-auto min-w-0 max-w-6xl overflow-x-hidden px-3 py-6 sm:px-6 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-700\">Advanced CBAM methodology</div><h1 class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 mt-2 break-words text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl\">Actual &amp; complex-goods calculator</h1><p class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 mt-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-600\">Enter your own installation and supplier data. This page no longer loads demonstration country, CN code, route, emissions, mass or price values.</p></div><a class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-slate-700 sm:w-auto\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">← Main calculator</a></div><section class=\"min-w-0 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 mt-6\" aria-label=\"CBAM actual / complex goods anonymous workspace\"><input type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" class=\"hidden\"/><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-emerald-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-800\">No signup required</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600\">Browser autosave</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600\">CBAM-Actual-V1 · Workspace-V2.7</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-black text-slate-950 sm:text-base\">Anonymous workspace</h2><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600 sm:text-sm\">Work without an account. Your unfinished work is autosaved in this browser. Download a JSON backup if you want to move the project to another device or protect against cleared browser storage.</p></div><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:flex sm:w-auto sm:flex-wrap lg:justify-end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-black text-white sm:w-auto\">Download backup</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-black text-slate-800 sm:w-auto\">Import backup</button></div></div><details class=\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-white/80\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none px-3 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-800 sm:px-4\">Recent anonymous projects (<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</summary><div class=\"border-t border-emerald-100 p-3 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row\"><input class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\" placeholder=\"CBAM actual / complex goods project name\" aria-label=\"CBAM actual / complex goods local project name\" value=\"CBAM actual project\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-white sm:w-auto\">Save local copy</button></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500\">No named local projects yet. Autosave still protects the current draft.</p></div></details></section><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><section class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 min-w-0 space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 text-xl font-black\">Good &amp; process data</h2><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Country of origin</span><select class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\"><option value=\"\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\" selected=\"\">Select country</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">CN / TARIC code</span><input placeholder=\"e.g. 7208\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input font-mono\" value=\"\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Reporting / import year</span><select class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\"><option value=\"2026\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\" selected=\"\">2026</option><option value=\"2027\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2027</option><option value=\"2028\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2028</option><option value=\"2029\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2029</option><option value=\"2030\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2030</option><option value=\"2031\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2031</option><option value=\"2032\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2032</option><option value=\"2033\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2033</option><option value=\"2034\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">2034</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Production year</span><select class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\"><option value=\"2026\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\" selected=\"\">2026</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Production route</span><select class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\"><option value=\"\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\" selected=\"\">Auto / not specified</option><option value=\"A\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">A — grey clinker / cement</option><option value=\"B\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">B — white clinker / cement</option><option value=\"C\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">C — Carbon Steel BF/BOF</option><option value=\"D\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">D — Carbon Steel DRI/EAF</option><option value=\"E\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">E — Carbon Steel Scrap/EAF</option><option value=\"F\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">F — Low alloy Steel BF/BOF</option><option value=\"G\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">G — Low alloy Steel DRI/EAF</option><option value=\"H\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">H — Low alloy Steel Scrap/EAF</option><option value=\"J\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">J — High alloy Steel EAF</option><option value=\"K\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">K — primary Aluminium</option><option value=\"L\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">L — secondary Aluminium</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Installation activity level (t)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"Enter activity level\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\" value=\"\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Process direct emissions (tCO₂e)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"Enter direct emissions\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\" value=\"\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Process indirect emissions (tCO₂e)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\" value=\"0\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Imported mass (t)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"Enter imported mass\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\" value=\"\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Earlier YTD threshold-eligible mass (t)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\" value=\"0\"/></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Certificate-price period</span><select class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input\"><option value=\"planning\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\" selected=\"\">Planning price / manual</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-1 block text-xs font-black text-slate-600\">Planning price (€ / tCO₂e)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"Enter planning price\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 input read-only:bg-slate-100\" value=\"\"/></label></div><label class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"/><span class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"><strong class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">Actual emissions are supported by an accredited-verifier workflow.</strong><br class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"/><span class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 text-slate-500\">This records your confirmation only; the tool does not itself perform verification.</span></span></label><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5\"><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"><h3 class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 font-black\">Precursors</h3><p class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 text-xs text-slate-500\">Add only precursors that belong to this actual-data calculation.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-white sm:w-auto\">+ Add</button></div><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 mt-4 space-y-4\"></div></div><div class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5\"><label class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 flex gap-3 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"/><span class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\"><strong class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86\">Claim a qualifying carbon price paid in the country of origin</strong></span></label></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-f0d059f0fd3a1c86 w-full rounded-xl bg-indigo-700 px-5 py-3.5 font-black text-white disabled:opaci